        // CO2 density at standard conditions: ~1.98 kg/m³
        // 1 L/min = 1e-3 m³/min = 1e-3/60 m³/s
        // mass flow = density * volumetric flow
        // mass flow (kg/s) = 1.98 * (leak_rate L/min) * (1e-3 m³/L) * (1/60 s/min)
        // mass flow (kg/s) = leak_rate * 1.98 / 60000
